From fea1168020beec8ade9234b9904b52ead0b033f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shiruba <koko0909e@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 06:15:42 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Custom text animations; pause and reverse for widget
 animations and text

- TextCharAnimation: per-character keyframe animation (offset, scale,
  rotation, alpha, color) made in Aqua. UIText reveal/effect "Custom"
  use customReveal / customEffect (JSON), and the <custom> tag applies
  the custom effect to part of the text.
- UIText PauseReveal, HideReveal (reverse the reveal so the characters
  disappear from the last one; emits UIEventType::TextHidden) and
  ShowReveal. UIDocument PauseText / HideText / ShowText.
- WidgetDocument PauseAnimation / ResumeAnimation / IsAnimationPaused,
  ReverseAnimation (flip the direction, or play backwards from the end),
  PlayAnimationReverse, SetAnimationSpeed / SetAnimationTime /
  GetAnimationTime, and the same on UIDocument.
- RUTO_UI_CHAR_ANIMATION marks an SDK with these features.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
